import{_ as o,o as n,c as t,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 464 | Dragon Ball · Commoners' Situation: Ordinary People's Helplessness in a Combat-Power World","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 464 | Dragon Ball · Commoners' Situation: Ordinary People's Helplessness in a Combat-Power World","no":464,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Dragon Ball","Commoners' Situation","Ordinary People","Helplessness","Myriad-Ranks Republicanism"],"related":["08-Road-for-Everyone Guarantee System","36-Social Structure and Class Mobility","41-Symbiotic Labor Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0464_模块2-龙珠-平民处境-普通人在战力世界的无助.md","filePath":"en/0464_模块2-龙珠-平民处境-普通人在战力世界的无助.md"}`),a={name:"en/0464_模块2-龙珠-平民处境-普通人在战力世界的无助.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,u,d){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-464-dragon-ball-·-commoners-situation-ordinary-people-s-helplessness-in-a-combat-power-world" tabindex="-1">Entry 464 | Dragon Ball · Commoners&#39; Situation: Ordinary People&#39;s Helplessness in a Combat-Power World <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-464-dragon-ball-·-commoners-situation-ordinary-people-s-helplessness-in-a-combat-power-world" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 464 | Dragon Ball · Commoners&#39; Situation: Ordinary People&#39;s Helplessness in a Combat-Power World&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dragon Ball Full Decomposition (Entry 33 · Civilization Analysis 6) | Benchmark base: Documents 08, 36, 41</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-protecting-ordinary-people-is-only-a-line" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when &quot;protecting ordinary people&quot; is only a line <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-protecting-ordinary-people-is-only-a-line" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when &quot;protecting ordinary people&quot; is only a line&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball has a recurring line: &quot;I fight to protect Earth&#39;s ordinary people.&quot; But Earth&#39;s ordinary people over forty years of plot were never truly protected — Saiyans come and they hide in houses; Cell comes and they watch the livestream; Buu comes and they are one-shot killed. They have no cultivation ability, no weapons, no early warning; they are only backdrop when villains destroy. This entry takes the republican axiom of Myriad Races as core, dissecting Dragon Ball commoners&#39; helpless situation in a combat-power world.</p><p>This entry&#39;s judging base is the six top-level axioms and five mandatory cores, with the law-first axiom as core. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Commoners&#39; energy waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Ordinary people no cultivation qualification</strong>: Dragon Ball world&#39;s &quot;ki&quot; cultivation only transmitted privately between Turtle School and Crane School masters and disciples; ordinary people cannot even touch the basics</li><li><strong>Technology not converted to defense</strong>: Capsule Corp&#39;s technology only used to &quot;build spaceships for Goku&quot;; never builds defense weapons for commoners</li><li><strong>Early-warning system zero</strong>: Frieza comes, Cell comes, Buu comes; commoners every time &quot;suddenly hear&quot;; no early warning</li><li><strong>Conclusion</strong>: Dragon Ball world&#39;s ordinary people, at the combat-power level completely powerless</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How commoners&#39; helplessness feeds historical regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Civilization no self-organization ability</strong>: commoners cannot cultivate, cannot early-warn, cannot self-rescue; disaster comes and they can only wait for Goku</li><li><strong>Casualty numbers meaningless</strong>: Dragon Ball world every great war tens of millions die, but because can be revived, these casualties narratively zeroed</li><li><strong>Commoners no voice</strong>: Earth government in forty years of plot never had a presence; commoners&#39; demands no one represents</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Goku&#39;s role in commoners&#39; helplessness:</p><ul><li><strong>Accepting commoners&#39; helplessness</strong>: Goku never pushes commoners to cultivate, never builds early-warning system; he defaults &quot;I protect you and it&#39;s fine&quot;</li><li><strong>Treating commoners as chips</strong>: Tournament of Power&#39;s wager is 8 universes&#39; survival; Goku treats Myriad Ranks&#39; fate as a chip for &quot;wanting to trade blows with the strong&quot;</li><li><strong>No reflection after revival</strong>: every great war relies on Dragon Balls to revive; Goku never reflects &quot;why do commoners always die&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dragon Ball Commoners&#39; Helplessness</th><th>Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ordinary people no cultivation qualification</td><td>Road-for-everyone guarantee system (Doc 08): basic methods universal</td></tr><tr><td>Technology not converted to defense</td><td>Alaya Network + civilization-tier early warning; commoners have self-rescue ability</td></tr><tr><td>Early-warning system zero</td><td>20% activation strategy: commoners have self-organization ability</td></tr><tr><td>Casualty numbers meaningless</td><td>Causal self-discipline axiom: revival goes approval; trauma memory retained</td></tr><tr><td>Commoners no voice</td><td>Anchor Council: commoner representatives participate in legislation</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates Dragon Ball world; inject &quot;basic-method universal + early-warning system&quot;</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject &quot;Earth ordinary people cultivate ki,&quot; &quot;establish interstellar early warning,&quot; &quot;commoner representatives participate in parliament&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: count commoner casualty rate, commoner self-rescue rate, disaster mortality</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output <em>Dragon Ball Commoners&#39; Helplessness Cost Report</em>, quantifying &quot;ordinary people&#39;s helplessness in a combat-power world&quot;&#39;s loss to civilization</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Commoners&#39; setting self-consistency: low</strong> (ordinary people in forty years of plot have no change; always backdrop)</li><li><strong>Myriad-Ranks republican self-consistency expected: high</strong> (commoners have cultivation qualification, early warning, voice)</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong> (commoner casualties in original, Super, Heroes repeatedly &quot;revived&quot; to zero)</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high</strong> — commoners completely rely on Goku&#39;s protection; no self-rescue ability</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: ordinary people no cultivation qualification; civilization loses the vast majority of population&#39;s potential</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: commoner casualties &quot;revived&quot; to zero; suffering meaningless</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least benefited human mid-low tier cultivators; Dragon Ball&#39;s ordinary people do not even have entry</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: commoners as the vast majority of Myriad Ranks must be included in republicanism; not backdrop</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: after commoners have self-rescue ability, civilization no longer hangs on Goku alone</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power inherent in all; easygoing retain guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin eliminates predation motive</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dragon Ball&#39;s &quot;protect ordinary people&quot; is only a line — ordinary people were never truly protected, they were only revived. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer: let ordinary people themselves have roads. Basic methods universal, interstellar early-warning system, commoner representatives participate in parliament — let ordinary people from &quot;protected backdrop&quot; become &quot;co-build subjects of civilization&quot;; this is Dragon Ball commoners&#39; true way out.</p><p>One more layer: Dragon Ball world&#39;s commoners have an extremely cruel detail — they do not even know what &quot;ki&quot; is. Turtle School&#39;s cultivation is master-apprentice secret transmission; the vast majority of Earth&#39;s ordinary people their whole life do not know &quot;humans can fly.&quot; This means Dragon Ball world&#39;s commoners are not only &quot;cannot beat villains&quot;; they do not even know they can cultivate. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s road-for-everyone guarantee system (Doc 08) precisely breaks this &quot;knowledge black box&quot; — basic methods open to everyone, not because everyone can become Goku, but because everyone has the right to know &quot;humans can fly.&quot; The right to know itself is Myriad-Ranks republicanism&#39;s bottom line.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dragon Ball · commoners&#39; situation · ordinary people&#39;s helplessness in a combat-power world described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./463_模块2-龙珠-少年成长机制-天才的战斗宿命.html">Entry 463 · Youth Growth Mechanism</a> · <a href="./465_模块2-龙珠-文明权重分析-悟空个人权重碾压文明共识.html">Entry 465 · Civilizational-Weight Analysis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">08-Road-for-Everyone Guarantee System</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const p=o(a,[["render",r]]);export{h as __pageData,p as default};
